OL,5,G2000 Explore with Simon Reeve
OL,6,     FManila to Mindanao: Simon Reeve
OL,7,     Fleads a team of journalists into
OL,8,     Fthe Philippines, exploring the
OL,9,     Fnorthern mountainous rice terraces
OL,10,     Fand the war-torn Muslim regions of
OL,11,     Fthe south.
OL,12,G2100 Simon Reeve's South America
OL,13,     FSimon travels through Brazil,
OL,14,     Fvisiting a neglected indigenous
OL,15,     Fneighbourhood in Manaus and
OL,16,     Fmeeting a nurse who was the only
OL,17,     Fsource of healthcare during the
OL,18,     Fpandemic.
