OL,11,G0100 Find It, Fix It, Flog It
OL,12,     FThe boys head to Preston in
OL,13,     FLancashire to meet Claire who
OL,14,     Fworks for a local theatre company.
OL,15,     FSimon picks a stage light that's
OL,16,     Fno longer needed, while Henry
OL,17,     Fpicks a vintage railway lamp.
